## sandbox
# Anthropic's sandbox runtime (the `srt` command). Pinned to the version the
# agentic repo's replay harness is tested with; raise it there first. On Linux
# it also needs bubblewrap and socat (both in the Bluefin base image) and
# ripgrep (Brewfile.dev). Homebrew cannot match a pinned name to what is
# installed: `brew bundle` reinstalls this version on every run, and
# `brew bundle cleanup` would remove it and every other global npm package.
npm "@anthropic-ai/sandbox-runtime@0.0.82"
